        "procedure": "Dy(acac)·xH2O (0.25 mmol, 208.8 mg) and Dy(TFA)3 (0.125 mmol, 62.7 mg) were dissolved in CH2Cl2/THF (1:1, 4 mL) and added to a 4 mL CH2Cl2 solution of BPyTz (0.125 mmol, 33.8 mg). The mixture was stirred for a few hours. The resulting dark purple solution was filtered under gravity. Dark green crystals were obtained by vapor diffusion using hexane as antisolvent after approximately 2 days. Lattice contains ~3.5 CH2Cl2.",
